    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Binding Filtration & Reaction",
      "id": "detail-dialog",
      "intro": "Melalui jendela dialog penuh (Full-screen Details Dialog) yang diakses dari tombol *View Dialog* di panel detail, Anda dapat mengatur ikatan (Binding) konfigurasi *Filtration* dan *Reaction* untuk Scenario Group tersebut.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Filtration Binding",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Tab **Filtration** menampilkan daftar filter yang diterapkan pada level grup.\n• *Filtration* pada grup berguna untuk menyaring transaksi secara umum (misal: hanya berlaku untuk kartu Visa, atau transaksi di atas Rp 1.000.000) sebelum mengeksekusi *rule* individual di dalamnya.\n• Anda dapat melakukan **Add**, **Edit**, dan **Delete** untuk ikatan filter langsung dari tabel dalam tab ini.",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;width:340px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;display:flex;gap:16px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#f59e0b;border-bottom:2px solid #f59e0b;padding-bottom:12px;margin-bottom:-14px;\">Filtration</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;padding-bottom:12px;margin-bottom:-14px;\">Reaction</div></div><div style=\"padding:16px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;\">Bound Filters</div><button style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#f59e0b;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"5\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"19\"/><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"/></svg>Bind Filter</button></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"background:#f8fafc;padding:8px 12px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 80px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;\">Filter Name</span><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;text-align:right;\">Action</span></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 80px;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">High Amount Trx</div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:4px;background:#eff6ff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#3b82f6;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M11 4H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-7\"/><path d=\"M18.5 2.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L12 15l-4 1 1-4 9.5-9.5z\"/></svg></div><div style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:4px;background:#fef2f2;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#ef4444;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><polyline points=\"3 6 5 6 21 6\"/><path d=\"M19 6v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6m3 0V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2\"/></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Reaction Binding",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Tab **Reaction** menampilkan reaksi (tindakan otomatis) yang akan dieksekusi jika kondisi di Scenario Group terpenuhi.\n• Misal: Jika terdeteksi fraud, sistem secara otomatis akan mengirimkan SMS ke nasabah atau memblokir sementara kartu (melalui *API call* spesifik yang di-set di Reaction).\n• Sama halnya dengan Filtration, ikatan Reaction dapat diatur langsung di panel ini.",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;width:340px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;display:flex;gap:16px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;padding-bottom:12px;margin-bottom:-14px;\">Filtration</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#10b981;border-bottom:2px solid #10b981;padding-bottom:12px;margin-bottom:-14px;\">Reaction</div></div><div style=\"padding:16px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;\">Bound Reactions</div><button style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#10b981;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"5\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"19\"/><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"/></svg>Bind Reaction</button></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"background:#f8fafc;padding:8px 12px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 80px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;\">Reaction Name</span><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;text-align:right;\">Action</span></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 80px;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Block Card Temporary</div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:4px;background:#fef2f2;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#ef4444;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><polyline points=\"3 6 5 6 21 6\"/><path d=\"M19 6v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6m3 0V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2\"/></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
